          "tz": 600
        },
        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for lod_prepare_create",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for lod_prepare_create\n\nlod_prepare_create() is mdd's entry point for object creation: it\nruns lod_qos_parse_config() on the caller's optional striping buffer,\nthen walks ldo_comp_entries[] allocating every component the object's\nsize covers via lod_comp_prep_create(). It was untested.\n\nAdd lod_prepare_create_test.c, covering no OSTs available (-EIO\nbefore touching any striping), a two-component PFL layout where only\nthe component covering a 0-byte file's size gets instantiated, and a\ncaller-supplied V1 striping buffer that replaces the pre-set\ncomponent before allocation. Reuses the same fake lod_device/mock_tgt\nOST setup and lod_qos_declare_object_on() stub as lod_comp_test.c.\n\nExport lod_prepare_create(), needed by the new test module, and\nregister it in lustre/kunit/Makefile, KUNIT.modules_list and\nlod/KUNIT.list.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: AGENT:claude-sonnet-5 [claude-code]\nChange-Id: Iaca196046ae9d23debeead410562c37a91d5eb15\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
